      "62240756-2226-4389-8378-a3b6196913e9"]
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"84f9a202-0b2c-4324-b790-d13933b94bf6"], 
    Cell[TextData[{
     "a fixed-seed Poisson sprinkling into the unit causal diamond of 1 + 1 \
or 2 + 1 Minkowski space (",
     Cell[BoxData[
      TemplateBox[{
        Cell[
